 - **Billing account:** `cpf_cnpj` stores fiscal data for invoice generation.
 - **Enums:** `role` (`admin`, `owner`, `employee`); `subscriptions.status`; `tickets.channel`; `tickets.status` — values in business rules.
-- **Unique constraints:** `billing_accounts (entity_id)`; `entity_memberships (entity_id, user_id)`; `queues (entity_id, slug)`; `queue_access (entity_membership_id, queue_id)`; `tickets (queue_id, code)` per issuance window; `payments (asaas_payment_id)`; `subscriptions (billing_account_id)` (1:1).
+- **Unique constraints:** `entities (slug)` (`entities_slug_unique`); `entity_memberships (entity_id, user_id)` (`entity_memberships_entity_user_unique`) and `(entity_id, owner_seq)` (`entity_memberships_one_owner`); `billing_accounts (entity_id)`; `queues (entity_id, slug)`; `queue_access (entity_membership_id, queue_id)`; `tickets (queue_id, code)` per issuance window; `payments (asaas_payment_id)`; `subscriptions (billing_account_id)` (1:1).
